{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國國家航空航天局（NASA）宣佈，「毅力號」火星車已成為人類歷史上在地球以外天體表面行駛距離最遠的車輛。2026年10月，「毅力號」累計行駛距離達到45.22公裏，超過此前由「機遇號」火星車保持的45.16公裏紀錄。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1585496.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.589467+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T14:19:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"50be752bdb2bb670a6d7b0108fbc3d9d2a9d9c325f599aa47a3d732b8cca3784","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}